<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi authorities condemned the deadly attack on a Greek Orthodox church in Jordan and arrested suspects, while Iraqi leaders blamed external agents for the incident. The Iraqi prime minister pledged to place armed factions and weapons under state control by June 2027 and warned that these groups could be drawn into a US-Iran conflict. Iranian forces were accused of severe border violations and smuggling, and the Iraqi border with Saudi Arabia was declared fully secured. Saudi Arabia postponed a UN forum to 2027 amid regional tensions, and Türkiye is preparing to hand over the Bashiqa-Zilkan base to Iraq. 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9OeTc1VE5lcEx0QzNhVlh6TnBVZUhfdi1MR0xZQnJOLWo2U3dHb09ucVhPNXctSTFXNTF6R3EwZEJXSl96SF9zS2FPUWFwcHpHeFVMaGtUckZiaGIydHc1SFMwT3U1R1h5WnMtY2RGUkdtYm1jV2VUMWFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNcWFPNlR2cTBQejd2NG1mZ1JGZ2ZVYlZsWVgzWmRudFdnV2x5Sk5HYkJySWhPN3poVm96NF92N2l6NHlHLUN0bTZmU3VROW1vT2Z2bDZwaEN3bmdJNllVVDJPNTNheE5ZRFNnTWdUQzk0ODRKSkpfWTNPbWdqRUw3cnVZQWxpLUtTQTBmQXBwYnVPM1Bhamo5ME1TSDEtV1g3NWhfOUlkdW1xQ3d2Ymc?oc=5&quot;&gt;IraqiNews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE43eUxTZDFGaS1RTWgyY1llb2ZsQlMwYXRnSmpZN29KMFpOajVpMm1OaEl5dEtyUXR5TU94Zk9RbnBXY0ZZd3QyRTVLeHczYk9GUzdqVTdlc0puek9yNFktbXlWRi1lemlQUjNSRWFhakdQdHktSEJNOVBLZEpZcTA?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE1RRGY2MmJyQ1EwdDNzTVllUXpkQ0FoaHNlRnk3eWp0LXctV3V0Rkh4dnppS0pQR2RQeTJpV0JqdmZwVEFYb0JHbkgxZVFHeXRkS1VUOHBDWTFpcy11dl9LRzF2R1dvOVVzRnJjYVpvQlZiRTZ3MDBOVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://new